//! The clock key `rom`, the default: the kernel writes no clock register and
//! the part runs at whatever the mask ROM left.
//!
//! One of the `s3clock` modules, mapped by a case's `clock` (the runner) or an
//! image's `[keys]` (`sosimage`). The HAL re-exports its `clock_init`, which
//! `kmain` calls first (`../../kernel/lib.saw`; `../../ABI.md` §14).

/// Set the CPU clock this image is built for: the one the ROM left, so
/// nothing is written.
public func clock_init() unsafe { }
